.TH RUNE-TUI 1 "2026-11-16" "rune" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rune-tui \- unofficial terminal chat client for LINE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rune-tui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fISESSION\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rune-tui
is an unofficial, third-party LINE client for the terminal. It is not
developed by, affiliated with, or endorsed by LY Corporation, and using it
may conflict with LINE's Terms of Use.
.PP
.I SESSION
is the saved login. When it does not exist,
.B rune-tui
logs in by QR code (scan it with the LINE app) and writes it, mode 0600.
It holds your tokens and Letter Sealing keys: keep it private.
.PP
Inside the app, \fBCtrl\-x\fR opens the main menu and \fB?\fR lists the keys
of the screen you are on.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-read\-receipts
Never mark chats as read; others see no read receipt.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-graphics
Draw pictures with text instead of the terminal's image protocol (Kitty,
Sixel, iTerm2).
.TP
.BI \-\-cells " MODE"
Glyphs for text pictures:
.BR quadrant " (default), " sextant " or " half .
.TP
.B \-\-no\-mouse
Leave the mouse to the terminal (for text selection).
.TP
.BI \-\-db " PATH"
The local message store (default: \fISESSION\fR with the extension
\fB.db\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-store
Keep nothing on disk (an in-memory store).
.TP
.BI \-\-log " PATH"
Append diagnostics to \fIPATH\fR (mode 0600). \fBRUST_LOG\fR sets the
level (default \fBinfo\fR). Tokens and message text are never logged.
.TP
.BI \-\-plugins " DIR"
Where plugins are installed (default: \fI$XDG_DATA_HOME/rune/plugins\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-plugins
Start no plugin this run; they stay enabled.
.TP
.B \-\-default\-keys
Use the default keyboard shortcuts this run; yours stay saved.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the options.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/rune/session.json
The default \fISESSION\fR (\fI~/.local/share/rune/\fR when
\fBXDG_DATA_HOME\fR is unset). When it does not exist but
\fI./session.json\fR does, that one is used.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/rune/session.db
The local message store: chats, decrypted messages, contacts, settings.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/rune/ltsm.wasm
LINE's secure module, which signs every request. It is not distributed with
rune: it is taken from the LINE Chrome extension (version 3.7.2) installed in
Chrome, Chromium, Brave, Edge or Vivaldi, or from this path, or from
\fB$RUNE_LTSM\fR.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/rune/plugins/
Installed plugins.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/rune/keys.json
Your keyboard shortcuts.
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/rune/view/
Media opened from chats (\fI~/.cache/rune/view/\fR by default; owner-only,
emptied of old files at start).
.TP
.I ~/Downloads/rune/
Media saved from chats.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUNE_LTSM
Path of \fIltsm.wasm\fR; when set, nowhere else is searched.
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Log level for \fB\-\-log\fR, for example \fBrune=debug\fR.
.TP
.B COLORFGBG ", " COLORTERM
Pick the light or dark palette and true colour.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on a normal quit, 1 on an error (printed on standard error).
.SH NOTES
Reading a chat sends a read receipt unless \fB\-\-no\-read\-receipts\fR is
given; sending messages and reading chats are visible to other people.
